    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DNG Farrelly Southern is delighted to present this beautifully refurbished three-bedroom, three-bathroom home to the rental market.\nNewly refurbished throughout, the property is presented in excellent condition and offers bright, comfortable and well-proportioned accommodation. The ground floor comprises an entrance hallway, spacious living room, kitchen and dining area, and guest WC with access to a generous rear garden.\n\nUpstairs, there are three bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, together with a bathroom. \n\nThe house occupies an attractive end position and benefits from off-street parking on the driveway, gated side access and a large private rear garden?ideal for outdoor dining and relaxation.\n\nStraffan Wood is a mature and highly regarded residential development within easy walking distance of Maynooth town centre. The town offers an excellent selection of shops, supermarkets, cafes, restaurants, leisure facilities, schools and childcare services, with Maynooth University also conveniently located nearby.\n\nMaynooth Train Station and regular Dublin Bus services are within walking distance, while the M4 motorway is only minutes away, providing convenient access to Dublin and the surrounding areas. The Royal Canal Greenway, Carton House Estate and a range of local sporting and recreational amenities are also easily accessible.\n\nInterested applicants should apply by email and provide full details of their circumstances, including the number of proposed occupants, preferred move-in date and any other relevant information. Please note that, due to the anticipated volume of enquiries, applications containing full details will be prioritised.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "* Newly refurbished throughout\n* Three bedrooms\n* Three bathrooms\n* Main bedroom with ensuite\n* Bright and spacious living accommodation\n* Off-street parking on the driveway\n* Attractive end position\n* Gated side access\n* Large private rear garden\n* Sought-after Straffan Wood development\n* Walking distance of Maynooth town centre\n* Excellent public transport and motorway connections\n\nMains - Electricity, Mains Gas\n"
